  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is a significant advantage. With IaC, infrastructure definitions are version-controlled and can be quickly redeployed, enabling faster and more reliable disaster recovery by recreating the environment from a known good state. Option B (incorrect) is false; IaC helps define and enforce security configurations, but it doesn''t eliminate the need for them. Option C (incorrect) is false; Terraform is a CLI tool and uses HCL, not a visual design interface. Option D (incorrect) is false; IaC manages infrastructure, not application code optimization.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain69_16',
  NOW(),
  18,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_69_2',
