  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) highlights consistency, a primary benefit of IaC. By defining infrastructure in code, Terraform ensures that every environment provisioned from that code is identical, eliminating manual configuration errors and inconsistencies. Option B (incorrect) is not a direct or guaranteed benefit of IaC itself; while IaC can enable cost optimization practices, it doesn''t automatically select the cheapest resources. Option C (incorrect) is a security best practice that can be implemented alongside IaC, but it''s not a core benefit of IaC''s provisioning mechanism. Option D (incorrect) relates to operational monitoring, which is outside the scope of IaC''s primary provisioning and management functions.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain69_16',
  NOW(),
  20,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_69_2',
  'hard'
);

