  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is the `terraform` block''s `required_providers` nested block. This is where you declare the providers your configuration needs and specify version constraints for them. Option A (`resource` block) defines infrastructure resources. Option B (`provider` block) configures specific instances of a provider. Option D (`variable` block) declares input variables.',
