  'A development environment managed by Terraform needs to be completely torn down at the end of a sprint. The team has a Terraform configuration that defines all the resources for this environment. They want to initiate the destruction process, but only for the resources within this specific development configuration, and they want to be prompted for confirmation before any resources are actually deleted. Which command should they execute?',
