  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) `terraform destroy -target=aws_instance.test_server` is the correct command to destroy a specific resource while leaving others untouched. The `-target` flag limits the scope of the `destroy` operation to only the specified resource. By default, `terraform destroy` will prompt for confirmation. Option B (`terraform apply -destroy -target=aws_instance.test_server`) is incorrect; `terraform apply -destroy` is not a direct command for targeted destruction. Options C (`terraform remove`) and D (`terraform delete`) are not valid Terraform CLI commands.',
