  '["-auto-approve","-force","-confirm","-yes"]'::json,
  '{0}',
  'Option A (-auto-approve) is the correct flag for `terraform destroy` to automatically approve the destruction plan without requiring user confirmation. This is essential for non-interactive environments like CI/CD pipelines. Option B (-force) is not a valid flag for `terraform destroy`. Option C (-confirm) is not a valid flag. Option D (-yes) is not the standard flag; `-auto-approve` is the correct and canonical flag for this purpose.',
