  '{0}',
  'Option A (-target=aws_s3_bucket.my_bucket) is the correct flag. The `-target` flag allows you to specify one or more resources to operate on, limiting the scope of the `destroy` command to only those specified resources. Option B (-resource), Option C (-only), and Option D (-scope) are not valid flags for targeting resources with `terraform destroy`.',
