  '{0}',
  'Option A (terraform fmt -diff) is the correct command. The `-diff` flag shows the differences between the current file content and what it would be after formatting, without actually modifying the files. Option B (`terraform fmt -check`) only reports if files are unformatted but doesn''t show the specific changes. Option C (`terraform fmt -write=false`) prints the formatted output to stdout but doesn''t show a diff against the original. Option D (`terraform fmt -preview`) is not a valid flag for `terraform fmt`.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain71_16',
