  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) `terraform test` is not a core step in the standard Terraform workflow (init, plan, apply, destroy). While testing is important, `terraform test` is a newer experimental command for unit and integration testing, not part of the fundamental provisioning cycle. Options A, B, and D are all essential core workflow steps.',
