  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is the `set` type. A set is a collection of unique values where the order of elements is not guaranteed. Option B (list) is an ordered collection that allows duplicates. Option C (map) is a collection of key-value pairs. Option D (object) is a structured type with named attributes.',
