  'A Terraform module needs to accept a variable that defines multiple network interfaces for an EC2 instance. Each interface requires a subnet ID, a list of security group IDs, and a flag indicating if it''s the primary interface. Which variable type is MOST appropriate for this scenario to ensure structured and type-safe input?',
