  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is a classic use case for a `data` block. If you need to reference an existing infrastructure component that is not managed by your current Terraform configuration, a `data` block is used to fetch its attributes. Option A and Option B both describe creating new infrastructure, which is the role of a `resource` block. Option D describes module creation, which can contain both `resource` and `data` blocks.',
