  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is the `data` block. Data blocks are specifically designed to query information about infrastructure or services that exist outside of Terraform''s direct management, or that were created by a different Terraform configuration. Option B (`resource` block) manages infrastructure. Option C (`provider` block) configures cloud providers. Option D (`terraform` block) configures Terraform''s behavior.',
