  'Terraform configuration files are written in HashiCorp Configuration Language (Option D). Their primary role is to define the desired state of the infrastructure (Option A). Within these files, users declare providers and their configurations (Option C) to interact with various services. Ultimately, they specify resources to be created, updated, or deleted (Option B) to achieve the desired infrastructure state.',
