  '{1,3,2,0}',
  'To remove a specific resource, first remove the resource block from the Terraform configuration (Option B). Next, ensure the working directory is initialized with `terraform init` (Option D) to ensure Terraform is ready. Then, execute `terraform plan` (Option C) to preview the resource deletion, verifying that only the intended resource will be removed. Finally, run `terraform apply` (Option A) to execute the removal plan and delete the resource from the cloud.',
