  '{3,1,2,0}',
  'The `terraform refresh` command is executed (Option D) to update the state file. Terraform then reads the current configuration from HCL files (Option B) to identify the resources it manages. Following this, Terraform queries the cloud provider for the actual state of resources (Option C) to get the most up-to-date information. Finally, Terraform updates the state file with the actual remote state (Option A), ensuring the state file accurately reflects the infrastructure.',
