  'Consistency is a key advantage of IaC. Option B (Infrastructure is defined in a single source of truth (HCL)) ensures all environments start from the same blueprint. Option D (Changes are applied uniformly to all target environments) prevents discrepancies. This leads to Option A (Configuration drift is minimized over time) as Terraform actively manages the state. Ultimately, Option C (All environments reflect the desired defined state) is the outcome.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain69_16',
  NOW(),
  40,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_69_2',
  'easy'
);

