  '{3,0,2,1}',
  'Drift detection is a key IaC capability. Option D (Run `terraform plan` to compare the desired state with the current actual state) is the primary method to detect drift. Option A (Review the `terraform plan` output for unexpected changes) allows identification of discrepancies. Option C (Identify unexpected changes in the infrastructure or configuration) confirms the drift. Finally, Option B (Execute `terraform apply` to reconcile differences and restore desired state) brings the infrastructure back into alignment.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain69_16',
  NOW(),
  43,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_69_2',
