  'Auditability is enhanced by IaC. Option C (Version control history records all configuration changes with timestamps) provides a clear history of who changed what and when. Option A (Execution plans document proposed changes before application) serves as a record of intended changes. Option D (Terraform state file tracks the current attributes of managed resources) reflects the actual state. Option B (Cloud provider logs record all API calls made by Terraform) offers a low-level audit trail of actual operations.',
