  '{2,1,0,3}',
  'Reducing configuration errors starts with clarity and early detection. Option C (Define infrastructure in human-readable HCL files, making it easy to understand) ensures the configuration is comprehensible. Automated checks follow with Option B (Validate Terraform configuration syntax and semantics using `terraform validate`). Human oversight is provided by Option A (Perform peer reviews on Terraform code changes before merging to main branches). Finally, Option D (Use `terraform plan` to preview changes and catch potential issues before applying) offers a final verification step before execution.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain69_16',
