  '{3,2,0,1}',
  'To manage resources in a private cloud with a custom provider, resources for the private cloud are first defined in HCL (Option D). The custom provider plugin is then made available to Terraform (Option C), typically by placing it in a specific directory or configuring a custom plugin cache. The Terraform CLI interacts with the custom provider plugin (Option A) to process the HCL. Finally, the custom provider translates HCL to internal APIs or scripts (Option B) to manage the private cloud resources.',
  NOW(),
