  'To map a real-world resource to its state entry, Terraform first Option B (compares the configuration''s resource address with state entries). Then, Option C (Terraform identifies the resource by its ID in the state file). Next, Option A (Terraform queries the cloud API for resource details) using that ID. Finally, Option D (Terraform records the resource''s current attributes in state) to ensure consistency.',
