  'To detect drift, Terraform first Option B (reads the desired state from the configuration files). Then, Option C (Terraform fetches the actual state of resources from the cloud provider). Next, Option A (Terraform identifies discrepancies between desired and actual states). Finally, Option D (Terraform proposes changes to align actual state with desired state) in the execution plan.',
