  'To remove a provider, first remove all resource blocks that are associated with that provider from your configuration (Option C). Then, remove the corresponding entry for the provider from the `required_providers` block (Option B). Next, run `terraform init -migrate-state` to ensure that any lingering references to the provider are removed from the state file and that Terraform''s internal registry is updated (Option A). Finally, run `terraform plan` to confirm that no resources are unexpectedly managed by the removed provider and that the state is clean (Option D).',
