  'When a provider is needed, Terraform first downloads the provider plugin (Option A). After downloading, Terraform calculates the checksum of the downloaded plugin (Option C). This checksum is then stored in the dependency lock file (`.terraform.lock.hcl`) for future reference (Option D). In subsequent runs, Terraform verifies the downloaded plugin''s checksum against the one recorded in the lock file to ensure integrity and prevent tampering (Option B).',
