  '{1,3,0,2}',
  'To manage resources across multiple cloud providers, first declare both the `aws` and `azurerm` providers in the `required_providers` block of your configuration (Option B). Then, run `terraform init` to download and initialize both provider plugins (Option D). After initialization, you can define resource blocks for your AWS resources, which will implicitly use the `aws` provider (Option A). Similarly, define resource blocks for your Azure resources, which will implicitly use the `azurerm` provider (Option C).',
