  '{2,0,1,3}',
  'Terraform''s process for selecting a provider instance starts by identifying the resource''s type (e.g., `aws_instance`) (Option C). It then checks if the resource explicitly specifies a provider alias using the `provider` argument (Option A). If no alias is specified, Terraform uses the default provider instance for that resource''s type (Option B). Finally, Terraform resolves the specific provider configuration associated with the chosen instance to interact with the cloud (Option D).',
