  '{0,3,1,2}',
  'To configure an aliased provider with a version constraint, first define the `required_providers` block with version constraints for the base provider (Option A). It''s crucial to ensure that this overall version constraint allows for any specific needs of the aliased provider (Option D). Then, define a `provider` block with an `alias` and its specific configuration (Option B). Finally, run `terraform init` to download and initialize both the default and aliased provider instances (Option C).',
