  '{2,1,0,3}',
  'The most secure approach starts by avoiding hardcoding credentials directly in the Terraform configuration files (Option C). Instead, set environment variables for each account''s credentials (e.g., `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`) (Option B). Terraform providers are often configured to automatically pick up these environment variables, or you can explicitly reference them in the provider configuration blocks (Option A). Finally, run `terraform plan` or `apply` which will then utilize these securely provided credentials for the configured providers (Option D).',
