  'To use data across providers, first declare both providers in your `required_providers` block (Option B). Then, run `terraform init` to ensure both providers are initialized and their plugins are available (Option D). Next, define a data source block using the first provider to fetch the necessary information (Option C). Finally, define a resource block using the second provider, and reference the output from the data source for its configuration (Option A).',
