  '["Whitespace consistency.","Block indentation.","Resource naming conventions.","Provider version constraints.","Variable type definitions."]'::json,
  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (correct) and Option B (correct) are the main focus areas of `terraform fmt`. It standardizes whitespace, line endings, and block indentation to ensure a consistent code style. Option C (Resource naming conventions), Option D (Provider version constraints), and Option E (Variable type definitions) are aspects of the configuration content and logic, which `fmt` does not modify.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain71_16',
