  '{1,3}',
  'Option B (correct) `terraform fmt` enforces a canonical format, ensuring all team members'' code looks the same. Option D (correct) consistent formatting significantly improves the readability and maintainability of the Terraform code, which is crucial in team environments. Option A (incorrect) `terraform fmt` only formats; it does not correct syntax errors. `terraform validate` is used for syntax and configuration validation. Option C (incorrect) `terraform fmt` does not validate against the provider''s API; `terraform plan` or `terraform apply` would interact with the provider. Option E (incorrect) `terraform fmt` only modifies local files; `terraform apply` is used to apply infrastructure changes.',
  NOW(),
