  'mcq',
  '["By defining an `output` block for `instance_type` in the root module.","By setting `default = \"t3.small\"` in the root module''s `variable` block.","By passing `instance_type = \"t3.small\"` within the `module \"compute\"` block.","By using a `terraform.tfvars` file to declare `instance_type = \"t3.small\"`."]'::json,
