  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) highlights a key difference in addressing. Terraform Registry modules are referenced by a concise `namespace/name/provider` string (e.g., `hashicorp/aws/vpc`), whereas Git modules require a full Git URL. Option A is incorrect; the Terraform Registry supports private modules, and Git repositories can be public or private. Option C is incorrect; both support versioning, but the Registry integrates it more seamlessly. Option D is incorrect; both types of modules fully support input variables.',
