  'To confirm and execute a plan, you first run `terraform apply` to initiate the process (Option C). Terraform then displays the execution plan, and you review the detailed list of planned resource actions (Option B). After reviewing, you type ''yes'' at the prompt to confirm (Option A). Finally, you wait for Terraform to provision or modify resources (Option D) according to the confirmed plan.',
