  '{2,1,3,0}',
  'Option C (correct) is the foundational step: define a canonical formatting standard for the project, which `terraform fmt` provides. Next, Option B is to educate team members on running `terraform fmt` before committing code, promoting manual adherence. Then, Option D is to configure pre-commit hooks to automatically run `terraform fmt`, enforcing the standard at the commit stage. Finally, Option A is to integrate `terraform fmt -check` into CI/CD pipelines as a mandatory check, ensuring no unformatted code makes it to deployment.',
