  'Option A (correct) is the first step: update the provider version constraint in the configuration file to specify the desired new version. Next, Option B `terraform init -upgrade` is executed to force Terraform to download the latest acceptable version of the provider, respecting the new constraint. After initialization, verify the new provider version (Option C) is downloaded and active. Finally, execute `terraform plan` (Option D) to ensure that the provider upgrade does not introduce any unexpected infrastructure changes.',
