  'Option A (correct) is the first step: configure the remote backend in the `backend` block within the Terraform configuration files. Next, Option B `terraform init` is executed, which will detect the backend configuration and set it up. After initialization, it''s important to review the `terraform init` output (Option D) for successful backend configuration messages. Finally, confirm the state file is stored in the remote backend (Option C) by checking the backend''s storage location.',
