VALUES (
  'q_71_m_71_2_45',
  'A team needs to reconfigure their Terraform backend from local to remote (e.g., Amazon S3). Order the steps to safely migrate the Terraform state.',
  'ordering',
  '["Update the `backend` block in the configuration to specify the new remote backend","Run `terraform init -migrate-state`","Verify the state file has been successfully migrated to the remote backend","Run `terraform plan` to ensure no changes are detected after migration"]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'Option A (correct) is the first step: update the `backend` block in the configuration to specify the new remote backend details. Next, Option B `terraform init -migrate-state` is executed, which will detect the backend change and prompt to migrate the existing state. After the migration, verify the state file has been successfully migrated (Option C) by checking the remote backend''s location. Finally, Option D `terraform plan` should be run to ensure no infrastructure changes are detected, confirming a successful state migration without altering resources.',
