  '{2,0,3,1}',
  'Option C (correct) is the first step: remove any explicit `backend` block from the configuration, as the default backend is local. Next, Option A `terraform init` is executed, which will set up the local backend. After initialization, it''s important to review the `terraform init` output (Option D) for successful backend configuration messages. Finally, verify the `terraform.tfstate` file is created (Option B) in the working directory, confirming the local backend is active.',
