  '["Configure the Terraform Cloud backend in the configuration file","Run `terraform init`","Log in to Terraform Cloud via `terraform login` (if required)","Verify the state is now managed remotely by Terraform Cloud"]'::json,
  '{0,2,1,3}',
  'Option A (correct) is the first step: configure the Terraform Cloud backend in the configuration file, specifying the organization and workspace. Next, Option C `terraform login` is executed to authenticate with Terraform Cloud, if required. Then, Option B `terraform init` is run, which will detect the Terraform Cloud backend and configure the local working directory to use it. Finally, verify the state is now managed remotely (Option D) by checking the Terraform Cloud workspace.',
