  'To identify and correct a syntax error, you first locate the `.tf` file with the potential error (Option D). Then, run `terraform validate` and observe the error message (Option A), which will often point to the line number. Next, modify the `.tf` file to correct the syntax error (Option B). Finally, save the changes to the `.tf` file (Option C) and re-validate if needed.',
