  'Option C (correct) is the first step: save the Terraform configuration files after writing them. Next, Option A `terraform validate` is executed to perform a quick syntax and consistency check without connecting to any providers or state. After running the command, review the command output (Option B) for any reported syntax errors or warnings. Finally, make any necessary corrections to the configuration (Option D) if issues are identified.',
