  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (correct) is essential as the bucket name forms part of the S3 module source URL. Option B (correct) is essential as the object key specifies the exact location of the module archive within the bucket. Option C (incorrect) is typically inferred or configured globally for the AWS provider, not explicitly part of the S3 module source string itself. Option D (incorrect) is a separate argument for versioning, not part of the `source` URL for S3. Option E (incorrect) is for authentication and authorization, handled by the AWS provider configuration, not the module source string.',
