  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (correct) is a widely used source, allowing modules to be versioned and managed in standard SCM systems. Option B (correct) allows modules to be served from any HTTP server as a compressed archive. Option C (incorrect) is a different infrastructure-as-code service and not a Terraform module source. Option D (incorrect) is for container images, not Terraform modules. Option E (incorrect) is for Kubernetes package management, not Terraform modules.',
